### 1. GET all rooms (Expects 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. GET room by ID - Found (Expects 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 3. GET room by ID - Not Found (Expects 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999

### 4. POST create a new room (Expects 201 Created + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rooftop Room",
  "capacity": 12
}

### 5. PUT update existing room (Expects 200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seminar A (Updated)",
  "capacity": 15
}

### 6. PUT update non-existing room (Expects 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost Room",
  "capacity": 0
}

### 7. DELETE existing room (Expects 204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 8. DELETE non-existing room (Expects 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/999